G4673:
σορός, -οῦ, ἡ [in LXX: Genesis 50:26 (אָרוֹן), Job 21:32 A * ;]
(a) a cinerary urn (Hom.);
(b) a coffin (Hdt., i, 68, 3, al.): Luke 7:14.†

